"step 2": "In this context, the creditor's obligation to notify the debtor of the appointment of a representative under the Personal Finance (Management and Protection of Personal Financial Debtor) Act (Act No. 17386, Dec. 18, 2021) is crucial. The Act requires the creditor to notify the debtor of the appointment of a representative for the management of their personal financial debt.",
